# Portfolio traffic does not justify the AWS WAF monthly fixed cost. The public
# API is throttled at API Gateway and CloudFront serves a private static origin.
AVD-AWS-0011

# Public static web assets contain no secrets. SSE-S3 avoids a customer-managed
# KMS key's fixed monthly cost; Terraform state remains encrypted with a CMK.
AVD-AWS-0132

# The freight-platform ALB is intentionally internet-facing: it is the public
# entry point for the freight API (HTTPS-terminated, WAF-fronted decision is
# documented above). Making it internal would break the public API design.
AVD-AWS-0053

# The SNS alarm topic carries operational notifications, not sensitive data.
# It is encrypted at rest with the AWS-managed SNS key (alias/aws/sns); a
# customer-managed KMS key would add a fixed monthly cost for no security
# benefit here (same rationale as the SSE-S3 decision above).
AVD-AWS-0136
